1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:06,700
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:18,367
[JUNE]<i> You also like
</i> leftover rice?

3
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:21,467
<i> Hey! Save some for me!</i>

4
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:29,233
[JUNE] Here.

5
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:31,300
<i> Ima-Asim Homemade Vinegar.</i>

6
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,967
<i>If you make a sour face,
you're mine.</i>

7
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:44,700
[PHONE CHIMES]

8
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,067
"You should get your things."

9
00:00:51,067 --> 00:00:58,000
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

10
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,533
Dear,

11
00:01:03,533 --> 00:01:07,533
your father never treated you
like you're not his.

12
00:01:07,567 --> 00:01:09,167
That's true.

13
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,333
And I know that he loved me too.

14
00:01:12,667 --> 00:01:15,400
He never once failed
in making me feel otherwise.

15
00:01:17,567 --> 00:01:18,633
Then...

16
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:21,267
why are you still so blue?

17
00:01:22,767 --> 00:01:25,733
Ima, I miss Ping.

18
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:31,133
Have you really fallen
in love with him?

19
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:36,133
But...

20
00:01:36,133 --> 00:01:39,433
I'm not sure if he feels
the same way for me.

21
00:01:39,433 --> 00:01:40,433
Ima,

22
00:01:40,467 --> 00:01:42,633
he has shown me everything,

23
00:01:42,633 --> 00:01:44,433
all of his kindness.

24
00:01:44,433 --> 00:01:46,333
I'm still so confused, Ima.

25
00:01:46,667 --> 00:01:50,600
I don't know if it's because
I'm Don Nato's heir...

26
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:52,767
or because it's actually real.

27
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,767
Why don't you ask him then?

28
00:01:54,767 --> 00:01:58,533
But I don't know how
to face him anymore!

29
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,833
He just thinks...

30
00:02:01,567 --> 00:02:03,300
that I'm money-obsessed.

31
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:05,167
Look at the message he sent me.

32
00:02:07,267 --> 00:02:09,767
Huh? He's asking you to come!

33
00:02:09,767 --> 00:02:12,233
Ima, there are no emojis!

34
00:02:12,233 --> 00:02:13,567
There's no GIF!

35
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,567
Meaning, he doesn't have
feelings for me anymore.

36
00:02:16,567 --> 00:02:18,333
Darling, hold on.

37
00:02:18,667 --> 00:02:20,767
Didn't you already put
everything on the line

38
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,300
when you haven't
fallen for him yet before

39
00:02:23,300 --> 00:02:24,600
just for money?

40
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,733
Why don't you try
risking it all again?

41
00:02:27,367 --> 00:02:29,267
You have nothing to lose!

42
00:02:29,267 --> 00:02:36,233
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]
